{
  "name": "FB Messenger AI Chatbot — Bangla/Banglish",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FB Messenger AI Chatbot (Bangla / Banglish)\n\n**Before activating, set these once:**\n1. Replace every `REPLACE_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` with your Google Sheet ID (from the sheet URL).\n2. Set FB Page token in the **Send FB Reply** & **Send Followup** nodes (header `Authorization` value).\n3. Connect credentials:\n   - Google Sheets OAuth2\n   - OpenAI API\n   - Telegram Bot\n4. In Telegram nodes, set your `chatId` (Telegram CHAT_ID for support alerts).\n5. Webhook URL → paste into Facebook App → Messenger → Webhook callback URL.\n\n**Flow:**\nMessenger Webhook → extract text/audio → (Whisper transcribe if audio) → load User row + Products catalog from Google Sheets → AI Agent (OpenAI + Simple Memory, sessionKey = psid) → JSON output is routed by Switch:\n  • `order_update` → upsert Orders sheet\n  • `lead_update` → update Users sheet\n  • `human_support` → notify you on Telegram\n  • `reply` → just send back\nFinally update Users `last_user_msg / last_bot_msg / last_message_at`, then send the reply to FB.\n\nSeparate Schedule Trigger runs every 8 hours, finds leads with no activity > 8h and sends a friendly Banglish nudge, then bumps `followup_count`.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "note-readme",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1760, -120]
    },

